{"seq":3,"slug":"procedural-shake-effects","title":"程序化震动与特效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/dynamic-systems/procedural-shake-effects","wordCount":1649,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"程序化震动与特效\">程序化震动与特效</h1><p>一拳挥空和一拳砸实，差别往往不在伤害数字，而在屏幕有没有「震」那一下。爆炸、受击、巨兽落地、引擎轰鸣——这些冲击感很大一部分由相机的程序化运动传达。手动 K 帧每一次震动既不现实也不可复用，正确做法是用噪声和冲量模型程序化地生成抖动，叠加在相机的最终输出上。这篇讲怎么让相机「有肉感」却不失控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>程序化震动是叠加在相机基础位姿之上的一层扰动：基础位姿由跟随、注视、状态混合决定，震动层在其上加一个随时间变化的小偏移和小旋转。关键是这层扰动必须<strong>程序化生成</strong>（不靠手 K）、<strong>可叠加</strong>（多个震动源共存）、<strong>可统一缩放</strong>（一个总开关能降为零，关乎舒适度）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  BASE[基础位姿: 跟随+注视+混合] --&gt; ADD[叠加震动层]&#10;  SRC1[受击冲量] --&gt; NOISE[噪声采样]&#10;  SRC2[爆炸冲量] --&gt; NOISE&#10;  SRC3[持续环境抖动] --&gt; NOISE&#10;  NOISE --&gt; ENV[包络: trauma 衰减]&#10;  ENV --&gt; ADD&#10;  ADD --&gt; SCALE[全局舒适度缩放]&#10;  SCALE --&gt; OUT[最终相机位姿]\">flowchart TD\n  BASE[基础位姿: 跟随+注视+混合] --&gt; ADD[叠加震动层]\n  SRC1[受击冲量] --&gt; NOISE[噪声采样]\n  SRC2[爆炸冲量] --&gt; NOISE\n  SRC3[持续环境抖动] --&gt; NOISE\n  NOISE --&gt; ENV[包络: trauma 衰减]\n  ENV --&gt; ADD\n  ADD --&gt; SCALE[全局舒适度缩放]\n  SCALE --&gt; OUT[最终相机位姿]</pre><p>下表区分两类震动来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>时长</th>\n<th>模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冲击式</td>\n<td>受击、爆炸、落地</td>\n<td>短，衰减</td>\n<td>trauma + 噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续式</td>\n<td>引擎、地震、奔跑</td>\n<td>长，恒定/呼吸</td>\n<td>低频噪声循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么用噪声而非随机数\">为什么用噪声而非随机数</h2><p>最容易想到的「每帧给相机加个随机偏移」会产生刺眼的高频跳变——画面像信号没接好的电视，难看且致晕。问题在于纯随机数在时间上不连续，相邻帧毫无关联。</p>\n<p><strong>Perlin 噪声</strong>（及其改良 Simplex 噪声）解决了这个问题：它在时间维度上连续、平滑，相邻采样值接近，给出的是「有机的、像手持摄影机的轻微晃动」而非「电气故障」。做法是为相机的每个自由度（X/Y 位移、yaw/pitch/roll 旋转）各取一条独立的噪声曲线，用不同的频率与相位采样，避免各轴同步导致的呆板。Cinemachine 3 的 Noise（旧称 Basic Multi-Channel Perlin）组件正是这套思路——给每个通道配频率和幅度。</p>\n<p>采样形式大致是：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个自由度的扰动</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>noise</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_i(t) = A_i \\cdot \\big(2\\,\\text{noise}(f_i\\, t + \\phi_i) - 1\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">noise</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是幅度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是频率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是相位偏移。把噪声值从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 重映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 保证零均值——否则相机会偏向一侧漂移。频率决定「快慢」，幅度决定「大小」，环境抖动用低频小幅，剧烈受击用高频（短时）大幅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"trauma-模型-冲击的非线性衰减\">Trauma 模型：冲击的非线性衰减</h2><p>环境抖动是恒定的，但受击、爆炸是「一下子很猛、迅速平息」。直接线性衰减幅度显得机械。游戏开发者 Squirrel Eiserloh 提出的 <strong>trauma 模型</strong>是业界经典解法：维护一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的「创伤值」trauma，受击时往上加（多次受击累积、封顶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），每帧自然衰减；实际震动幅度取 trauma 的<strong>幂次</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shake</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>trauma</mtext><mi>k</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shake} = \\text{trauma}^k,\\qquad k \\in \\{2, 3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shake</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trauma</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取平方或立方的关键作用是：trauma 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 衰减到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，shake 衰减得更快、更有「爆发后迅速归于平静」的非线性手感；同时把幅度与噪声相乘，让强震和弱震用同一套噪声曲线、只是幅度不同。trauma 每帧线性递减（如每秒减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），多个冲击可叠加 trauma 但震动不会简单相加爆表。这套模型简单、可调、手感好，是 2026 年仍被广泛采用的事实标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲量系统与多源叠加\">冲量系统与多源叠加</h2><p>大型项目里震动源很多：玩家受击、附近爆炸、队友落地、Boss 踏步。把它们都塞进一个全局 trauma 会丢失空间信息——远处的爆炸该比近处轻。<strong>冲量系统</strong>（impulse）解决这点：每个震动事件是一个有位置、强度、衰减半径的冲量源，相机（冲量监听者）根据自己到冲量源的距离衰减后接收，多个冲量在监听端叠加。Cinemachine 3 的 Impulse Source / Impulse Listener 就是这套架构。</p>\n<p>距离衰减常用平方反比或自定义曲线：离爆炸越远，接收到的冲量越小，超出半径为零。叠加时各冲量的噪声偏移相加，但要给总幅度封顶，防止同时多个大冲量把相机甩出天际。下表给出常见特效的震动配方：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特效</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>幅度</th>\n<th>衰减</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻击命中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>配合命中停顿更佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重击/处决</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中 + 命中停顿</td>\n<td>可加短促拉近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爆炸</td>\n<td>高→低</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中，按距离</td>\n<td>冲量 + 半径衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巨兽落地</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>低频更有「重量」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎/地震</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>循环噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>震动常与其他「冲击感」手段联动：命中停顿（hitstop，短暂冻结时间）、镜头拉近、色差/径向模糊后效。这些屏幕特效属于游戏手感的范畴，相机震动是其中视觉占比最大的一块，详见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/interaction-feel/game-feel-juice\">游戏手感与打磨</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"舒适度-必须能一键归零\">舒适度：必须能一键归零</h2><p>程序化震动是晕动症的高发区——前庭系统感知到的运动与画面晃动不匹配，敏感玩家会头晕反胃。因此所有震动幅度都必须经过一个<strong>全局舒适度缩放</strong>因子，玩家可在设置里把「镜头摇晃」「震动强度」从 100% 调到 0%。这个缩放要乘在所有噪声、trauma、冲量的最终幅度上，确保归零时相机彻底稳定。把震动做成不可关闭，是无障碍审查里的硬伤。这条缩放链路怎么设计、阈值怎么取，见 <a href=\"../craft-practice/motion-sickness-comfort\">晕动症与舒适度</a>，而暴露给玩家的开关属于 <a href=\"../framing-control/input-control-schemes\">输入与控制方案</a> 的选项清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>程序化震动是叠加在基础位姿上的扰动层，要程序化生成、可叠加、可统一缩放归零。</li>\n<li>用 Perlin/Simplex 噪声而非纯随机数，保证时间连续、各轴独立频率相位，得到有机晃动。</li>\n<li>trauma 模型用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shake</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>trauma</mtext><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shake}=\\text{trauma}^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shake</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8541em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trauma</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8541em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.068em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）给冲击非线性衰减，是事实标准。</li>\n<li>冲量系统让震动按到震源距离衰减、在监听端叠加并封顶，保留空间信息。</li>\n<li>所有震动幅度必须乘全局舒适度缩放，玩家可一键归零——这是无障碍硬性要求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：震动叠加在哪台相机的输出上由 <a href=\"camera-state-blending\">相机状态与混合</a> 决定；噪声偏移用到的位姿/坐标见 <a href=\"../foundations/camera-coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间与变换</a>；归零开关与阈值见 <a href=\"../craft-practice/motion-sickness-comfort\">晕动症与舒适度</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：受击触发震动的时机来自 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun\">受击反应与硬直</a>；震动作为游戏手感的一环见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/interaction-feel/game-feel-juice\">游戏手感与打磨</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"程序化震动与特效","id":"程序化震动与特效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么用噪声而非随机数","id":"为什么用噪声而非随机数"},{"level":2,"text":"Trauma 模型：冲击的非线性衰减","id":"trauma-模型-冲击的非线性衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"冲量系统与多源叠加","id":"冲量系统与多源叠加"},{"level":2,"text":"舒适度：必须能一键归零","id":"舒适度-必须能一键归零"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"注视与目标聚焦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/dynamic-systems/look-at-targeting"},"next":{"title":"过场与脚本化镜头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/craft-practice/cinematic-scripted-cameras"}}